# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# Checkpoints of a Python simulation (D[python-checkpoints]) on the GPU in
# double precision, scenario python-to-cli of Inputs/python_checkpoints.py.
# A Python simulation writes its checkpoint at step 10 and `mdir run
# --continue` takes it to step 20: equal to a Python continuation of the
# same file and to the run of `mdir run` that did not stop, to the bit,
# with the energy file and the trajectory byte for byte.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_checkpoints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU Double mdir %t python-to-cli | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: Python -> mdir run NVE GPU Double
# CHECK: Python -> mdir run NVT GPU Double
# CHECK: Python -> mdir run NPT GPU Double
# CHECK: checkpoints python-to-cli GPU Double passed
